[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Student Performance Analytics Report — Bangladesh</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.7/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #1a5276;
    --primary-light: #2980b9;
    --accent: #e67e22;
    --accent-dark: #d35400;
    --success: #27ae60;
    --danger: #c0392b;
    --warning: #f39c12;
    --bg: #f8f9fa;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --text: #2c3e50;
    --text-muted: #7f8c8d;
    --border: #dee2e6;
    --kpi-gradient-1: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a5276, #2980b9);
    --kpi-gradient-2: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60, #2ecc71);
    --kpi-gradient-3: linear-gradient(135deg, #c0392b, #e74c3c);
    --kpi-gradient-4: linear-gradient(135deg, #8e44ad, #9b59b6);
    --kpi-gradient-5: linear-gradient(135deg, #e67e22, #f39c12);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .report-header {
    background: var(--kpi-gradient-1);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 48px 40px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .report-header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .report-header::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -40%;
    left: 20%;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .report-header h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .report-header .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 800px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .report-header .meta {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* KPI Cards */
  .kpi-section {
    margin-top: -36px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding: 0 24px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  .kpi-card {
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .kpi-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .kpi-card.kpi-1 { background: var(--kpi-gradient-1); }
  .kpi-card.kpi-2 { background: var(--kpi-gradient-2); }
  .kpi-card.kpi-3 { background: var(--kpi-gradient-3); }
  .kpi-card.kpi-4 { background: var(--kpi-gradient-4); }
  .kpi-card.kpi-5 { background: var(--kpi-gradient-5); }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .kpi-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    margin: 40px auto;
    max-width: 1200px;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary-light);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .section-desc {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Grid layouts */
  .grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .grid-3 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid-2, .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* Tables */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  th {
    background: #f1f4f8;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  tr:hover td { background: #f8fafc; }
  td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  /* Heatmap table */
  .heatmap td.heat {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    border: 2px solid #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* Chart containers */
  .chart-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 380px;
  }
  .chart-container canvas {
    max-height: 380px;
  }

  /* Stat pills */
  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .stat-pill {
    background: #f1f4f8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 120px;
  }
  .stat-pill .label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .stat-pill .value {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Insight box */
  .insight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef6ff, #f0f8ff);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-light);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .insight strong { color: var(--primary); }

  .insight-warn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9e7, #fdf2e9);
    border-left-color: var(--warning);
  }
  .insight-warn strong { color: var(--accent-dark); }

  .insight-success {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eafaf1, #e8f8f5);
    border-left-color: var(--success);
  }
  .insight-success strong { color: #1e8449; }

  /* Badge */
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .badge-up { background: #d5f5e3; color: #1e8449; }
  .badge-down { background: #fadbd8; color: #922b21; }
  .badge-neutral { background: #ebf5fb; color: #2471a3; }

  /* Recommendations */
  .rec-card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-light);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .rec-card h4 {
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .rec-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .rec-card .rec-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #ebf5fb;
    color: var(--primary-light);
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .report-footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  /* Progression arrow */
  .prog-arrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 16px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .prog-stage {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f1f4f8;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    min-width: 140px;
  }
  .prog-stage .stage-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .prog-stage .stage-value {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .prog-connector {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .toc {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .toc h3 {
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .toc ol {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .toc li {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .toc a {
    color: var(--primary-light);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
  .toc a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- HEADER -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<header class="report-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Student Performance Analytics Report</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of academic, socio-economic, and environmental factors affecting student performance across districts in Bangladesh.</p>
    <p class="meta">Dataset: 1,000 students &bull; 8 Districts &bull; SSC &amp; HSC Examinations &bull; Generated April 2026</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- KPI DASHBOARD -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="kpi-section">
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card kpi-1">
      <span class="kpi-label">Avg HSC Result</span>
      <span class="kpi-value">4.013</span>
      <span class="kpi-desc">Mean HSC GPA across all 1,000 students (0–5 scale)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card kpi-2">
      <span class="kpi-label">Excellent Rate</span>
      <span class="kpi-value">26.8%</span>
      <span class="kpi-desc">Students achieving HSC GPA ≥ 4.5 (top-tier performance)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card kpi-3">
      <span class="kpi-label">At-Risk Rate</span>
      <span class="kpi-value">0.0%</span>
      <span class="kpi-desc">Students with HSC GPA &lt; 3.0 — none in this dataset</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card kpi-4">
      <span class="kpi-label">GPA Progression Δ</span>
      <span class="kpi-value">+0.018</span>
      <span class="kpi-desc">Avg change from Previous GPA to HSC — marginal improvement</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card kpi-5">
      <span class="kpi-label">Attendance–HSC Corr.</span>
      <span class="kpi-value">−0.014</span>
      <span class="kpi-desc">Near-zero correlation — attendance alone does not predict HSC outcomes</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- TABLE OF CONTENTS -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="toc">
    <h3>Table of Contents</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#demographics">Student Demographic Overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="#academic">Academic Performance Analysis</a></li>
      <li><a href="#socioeconomic">Socio-Economic Factors and Their Impact on Performance</a></li>
      <li><a href="#behavior">Study Behavior and Attendance Patterns</a></li>
      <li><a href="#regional">Regional Performance Disparities</a></li>
      <li><a href="#recommendations">Key Findings and Policy Recommendations</a></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- SECTION 1: DEMOGRAPHICS -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="section" id="demographics">
  <h2 class="section-title">1. Student Demographic Overview</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Composition of the 1,000-student sample by gender, age, district, and school type.</p>

  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Gender Distribution</h3>
      <div class="chart-container"><canvas id="chartGender"></canvas></div>
      <div class="stat-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Female</span><span class="value">510 <small style="font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-muted)">(51.0%)</small></span></div>
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Male</span><span class="value">490 <small style="font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-muted)">(49.0%)</small></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Age Distribution</h3>
      <div class="chart-container"><canvas id="chartAge"></canvas></div>
      <div class="stat-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Age 15</span><span class="value">267</span></div>
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Age 16</span><span class="value">263</span></div>
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Age 17</span><span class="value">259</span></div>
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Age 18</span><span class="value">211</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-2">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>District Distribution</h3>
      <div class="chart-container"><canvas id="chartDistrict"></canvas></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>School Type</h3>
      <div class="chart-container"><canvas id="chartSchoolType"></canvas></div>
      <div class="stat-row" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Private</span><span class="value">524 <small style="font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-muted)">(52.4%)</small></span></div>
        <div class="stat-pill"><span class="label">Public</span><span class="value">476 <small style="font-size:.7rem;color:var(--text-muted)">(47.6%)</small></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight">
    <strong>Key Observation:</strong> The sample is well-balanced across gender (51% female, 49% male) and school type (52.4% private, 47.6% public). All eight major divisions are represented with between 117–133 students each, providing sufficient sub-group sizes for reliable district-level comparisons.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- SECTION 2: ACADEMIC PERFORMANCE -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="section" id="academic">
  <h2 class="section-title">2. Academic Performance Analysis</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Distribution and progression of Previous GPA, SSC Result, and HSC Result across the student population.</p>

  <!-- Progression Arrow -->
  <div class="card">
    <h3>GPA Progression Overview</h3>
    <div class="prog-arrow">
      <div class="prog-stage">
        <div class="stage-label">Previous GPA</div>
        <div class="stage-value">3.995</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-connector">→</div>
      <div class="prog-stage">
        <div class="stage-label">SSC Result</div>
        <div class="stage-value">4.257</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-connector">→</div>
      <div class="prog-stage">
        <div class="stage-label">HSC Result</div>
        <div class="stage-value">4.013</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="insight">
      <strong>Progression Pattern:</strong> Students show a notable +0.262 GPA boost from Previous GPA to SSC, followed by a −0.244 decline from SSC to HSC. The net change from Previous GPA to HSC is a marginal +0.018, suggesting that the SSC-to-HSC transition is where most academic ground is lost. Of 1,000 students, <strong>507 improved</strong> and <strong>484 declined</strong> between Previous GPA and HSC Result — an almost even split.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-2">
